# Quiz tiers for the CI gate.
#
# t1 and t2 gate the run: they need nothing beyond the repository, or a
# resource that CI provisions (wordnet, whisper sample audio, ffmpeg with the
# drawtext filter).
#
# t3 is excluded. A quiz that depends on a house checkout belongs to that
# house's own repository, which runs its own checks. Those quizzes are not run
# here, and they are not reported as an environment gap either: the house is
# not missing, it is simply out of scope for this repository.
#
# A tier that is in neither list is advisory: it is reported but not gated.
su name ci_gating_tiers ob text "t1,t2" ya
su name ci_excluded_tiers ob text "t3" ya
